# DRAW keymap preset: Krita (5.x default shortcuts - krita/kritamenu.action, plugins/tools/tools.action)
#
# Format: actionId keycode requireMods forbidMods [device button]
#   mods bits: 1=Ctrl 2=Shift 4=Alt. forbidMods 0 = every modifier the row does not require
#   (Shift stays allowed on printable non-letters like > { + _ , typed with it).
#   A row that must leave Shift+key alone (Ctrl+] vs Ctrl+Shift+]) writes forbidMods 6.
#   Ctrl+Shift+punctuation is the UNshifted key with Ctrl+Shift: Ctrl+Shift+' = 39 3 (not 34).
#   Keycodes: letters are lowercase ASCII (Shift+letter = the letter, requireMods 2);
#   Tab 9, Backspace 8, Enter 13, Insert 20992, Delete 21248, F1 15104 ... F10 17408,
#   F11 34048, F12 34304. Action ids: GUI/COMMAND.BM (CMD_init) / SHORTCUTS.md.
# How a keymap applies (CFG/BINDINGS.BM BINDINGS_apply):
#   - an action's Nth row moves its Nth key; a row past the keys it has ADDS one
#   - a DRAW key a row takes is unbound (that DRAW action loses the key)
#   - keys no row takes keep their DRAW meaning
# Mac apps: Cmd is Ctrl here, Option is Alt.
# Already the same in DRAW (no row): B freehand brush, E eraser mode, F fill, X swap colours,
#   [ ] brush size, Ctrl+Z / Ctrl+Shift+Z undo / redo, Ctrl+A select all, Ctrl+Shift+I
#   invert, Ctrl+H display selection, Ctrl+G group, Ctrl+PgUp / PgDn move layer, Ctrl+0
#   zoom 100%, Ctrl+= / Ctrl+- zoom, Ctrl+Shift+C copy merged, Ctrl+Alt+V paste at cursor,
#   Ctrl+F apply filter again, Ctrl+N / O / S / Shift+S / Q.
# Not in DRAW (no row): G gradient, I / O brush opacity - / +, K / L colour darker / lighter,
#   , . / brush presets, M mirror view, H colour history, U common colours, \ tool options,
#   F5 / F6 brush editor / presets, Ctrl+Shift+D reselect, PgUp / PgDn active layer,
#   ; previous layer, Ctrl+Y soft proofing (stays Redo).
# Krita gives the line, polygon, bezier and text tools no key, so DRAW's P (polygon),
#   Q (bezier) and T (text) go to Krita's jobs; L line stays.
# DRAW keys this preset takes: I picker (moves to P), M marquee (moves to Ctrl+R), Ctrl+R
#   reference image, Tab toolbar, F2 gradient mode, Shift+Delete BG transparent,
#   Shift+R filled rectangle. Kept because Krita leaves them unused: R rectangle, V move.

# --- Tools ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
104 112 0 0     # P        colour sampler         -> Picker
113 118 0 0     # V        (DRAW's move key, kept)
113 116 0 0     # T        move
8007 113 0 0    # Q        multibrush             -> Cycle Symmetry
325 116 1 0     # Ctrl+T   transform              -> Transform: Scale
1802 99 0 0     # C        crop                   -> Crop Canvas
108 114 0 0     # R        (DRAW's rectangle key, kept)
108 114 2 0     # Shift+R  rectangle tool
110 106 2 0     # Shift+J  ellipse tool
112 114 1 0     # Ctrl+R   rectangular selection  -> Marquee
121 106 0 0     # J        elliptical selection   -> Ellipse Select
518 100 0 0     # D        default colours (black / white)
2023 105 2 0    # Shift+I  colour selector        -> Advanced Color Picker
1703 13 1 0     # Ctrl+Enter  search actions      -> Command Palette

# --- Select / fill -----------------------------------------------------------------------
307 97 3 0      # Ctrl+Shift+A     deselect
313 8 2 0       # Shift+Backspace  fill with foreground
314 8 0 0       # Backspace        fill with background

# --- Layers ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
701 20992 0 0   # Insert        add paint layer    -> New Layer
707 106 1 0     # Ctrl+J        duplicate layer
323 106 3 0     # Ctrl+Shift+J  cut selection to new layer
321 106 5 0     # Ctrl+Alt+J    copy selection to new layer
722 103 5 0     # Ctrl+Alt+G    ungroup
705 101 1 0     # Ctrl+E        merge with layer below
706 101 3 0     # Ctrl+Shift+E  flatten image      -> Merge All Visible
726 15360 0 0   # F2            rename layer
702 21248 2 0   # Shift+Delete  remove layer

# --- View / image ---------------------------------------------------------------------
403 34048 0 0   # F11           (DRAW's own key, kept)
403 9 0 0       # Tab           canvas only        -> Toggle All UI
453 102 3 0     # Ctrl+Shift+F  full screen        -> Toggle Fullscreen
8101 39 0 0     # '             (DRAW's grid key, kept)
8101 39 3 0     # Ctrl+Shift+'  show grid
8104 59 3 0     # Ctrl+Shift+;  snap to grid
1805 105 5 0    # Ctrl+Alt+I    scale image        -> Resize Image with Content
1801 99 5 0     # Ctrl+Alt+C    resize canvas
